[SUPPORTED_GRAPHICS_MODES_COMMENT]
Graphics-mode bits: 1 = SD, 2 = HD, 4 = DE; combine the supported bits.
[GAME_DATA_VERSION_COMMENT]
0 = Reign of Chaos, 1 = The Frozen Throne; other IDs depend on the editor/game version.
[GAME_DATA_VERSION_CURRENT_COMMENT]
Current editor data: 0 = Reign of Chaos, 1 = The Frozen Throne, 2 = Forsaken Kingdom.
[ENEMY_PRIORITY_FLAGS_COMMENT]
Enemy start-location priority masks: bit 0 = player slot 0, bit 1 = player slot 1, and so on.
[MINIMAP_ALPHA_TILE_COLOR_COMMENT]
Packed minimap color for alpha tiles: 0xAARRGGBB; stored as unsigned 32-bit BGRA bytes.
[UNKNOWN_FLAGS_COMMENT]
Unidentified flag bits, preserved without interpretation.
